{"title": "Assimilated Growth", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Assimilated Growth</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assimilated_Growth.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Assimilated Growth.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Assimilated_Growth.jpg/250px-Assimilated_Growth.jpg?560e09\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Assimilated_Growth.jpg/375px-Assimilated_Growth.jpg?560e09 1.5x, /images/thumb/Assimilated_Growth.jpg/500px-Assimilated_Growth.jpg?560e09 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nCadaver Growth</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nAssimilatedGrowths<br />Enemy</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nSuffocation</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes (Kill Assimilated Employee)</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill (Bursting)</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nIrrelevant</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nImmune</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Assimilated Growth</b>, also referred to as its scan name <b>Assimilation tendril</b>, is an infectious entity that only grows within the interior of a moon. It is a variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Cadaver_Growth\">Cadaver Growth</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. As the name implies, the growths are red tendrils that release foreign matter into the air to begin assimilating employees.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Assimilated Growth</b> behaves similarly to the Cadaver Growth, selecting a random tile to initially spawn and grow on, infecting nearby players, etc. However, the <b>Assimilated Growth</b> can not be destroyed and has a significantly reduced base rate of infection. This is especially noticeable in singleplayer, where players can last most if not the entire day without ever dying to infection on its own without additional modifiers, such as getting hit by <a href=\"/wiki/Hyx#Assimilation\" title=\"Hyx\"><b>Hyx's hazards</b></a>.\n</p><p>When a player is about to burst and die, they will see a warning message reading \"IRREGULAR ORGAN MOVEMENT DETECTED!!! FOREIGN MATTER DETECTED!!! IRREGULAR BRAIN WAVE DETECTED!!!\", will hear ringing, and their screen will turn red. They will die shortly afterward and an <a href=\"/wiki/Assimilated_Employee\" title=\"Assimilated Employee\"><b>Assimilated Employee</b></a> will spawn from their body and corpse. An <b>Assimilated Employee</b> also spawns from infected players that die through most other means if infection has progressed far enough.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Conditions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Conditions\">&gt; Spawn Conditions</span></h2>\n<p>An <b>Assimilated Growth</b> will immediately spawn in the interior of <a href=\"/wiki/Hyx\" title=\"Hyx\"><b>Hyx</b></a>. An <b>Assimilated Growth</b> will also immediately spawn within the interiors of <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Faith\" title=\"Faith\"><b>Faith</b></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\"><b>Filitrios</b></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fission-C\" title=\"Fission-C\"><b>Fission-C</b></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gloom\" title=\"Gloom\"><b>Gloom</b></a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Utril\" title=\"Utril\"><b>Utril</b></a> if a <b>mysterious object</b> has been placed on an altar on their exteriors. An <b>Assimilated Growth</b> will also spawn within the interiors of <a href=\"/wiki/Centrus\" title=\"Centrus\"><b>Centrus</b></a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Vindict\" title=\"Vindict\"><b>Vindict</b></a> after placing the object on <b>Filitrios</b> or <b>Utril</b> respectively.<br /><br />The object is reset after being fired unless the <b>Brooding seeds</b> acquired from the hidden chamber on <a href=\"/wiki/Berunah\" title=\"Berunah\"><b>Berunah</b></a> are placed onto the exteriors of <a href=\"/wiki/Etern\" title=\"Etern\"><b>Etern</b></a>, <b>Filitrios</b>, <b>Fission-C</b>, <b>Gloom</b>, and <b>Utril</b>. The changes for every moon, including <b>Faith</b> regardless of if players moved the mysterious object in the <a href=\"/wiki/Faith#Secret_Passage\" title=\"Faith\"><b>Secret Passage</b></a>, become permanent on that save file if this condition is met. Oddly, <b>Etern</b> does not seem to spawn an <b>Assimilated Growth</b> despite also having an altar.</span></span>\n</p><p>None of these spawns contribute to total Power Level.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Assimilated growth <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">[Data not found]\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Growing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"5\" data-mwtitle=\"TendrilsGrow.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/TendrilsGrow.mp3?7f0a92\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/TendrilsGrow.mp3/TendrilsGrow.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Releasing Matter</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"8\" data-mwtitle=\"TendrilsMove2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/TendrilsMove2.mp3?5db219\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/TendrilsMove2.mp3/TendrilsMove2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Growing in Head</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"3\" data-mwtitle=\"GrowingInHead1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GrowingInHead1.mp3?df3570\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GrowingInHead1.mp3/GrowingInHead1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0